<title>USA: Int'l Jensen holders approve merger.</title>
<headline>Int'l Jensen holders approve merger.</headline>
<dateline>LINCOLNSHIRE, Ill. 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Jensen Inc said Wednesday its stockholders approved the previously announced merger agreement with Recoton Corp.</p>
<p>Also approved were related transactions, including International Jensen's merger with a Recoton subsidiary and the sale of assets of International Jensen's original equipment manufacturing business to a company owned by Robert Shaw, International Jensen chairman.</p>
<p>The merger is expected to be completed late Wednesday.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
